        "name": "diamond-pearl",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/8/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A large key for operating the doors of\nthe Valley Windworks in the canyon.\nIt was held by a Team Galactic Grunt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "platinum",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/9/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A large key for operating the doors of\nthe Valley Windworks in the canyon.\nIt was held by a Team Galactic Grunt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "heartgold-soulsilver",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/10/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Grande clé servant à ouvrir la porte\nde la centrale Les Éoliennes du canyon.\nUn sbire de la Team Galaxie la détenait.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A large key for operating the doors of\nthe Valley Windworks in the canyon.\nIt was held by a Team Galactic Grunt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A large key for operating the doors of\nthe Valley Windworks in the canyon.\nIt was held by a Team Galactic Grunt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-2-white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/14/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "たにまのはつでんしょの　とびらを\nあけしめする　おおきな　カギ。\nなぜか　ギンガだんが　もっていた。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "골짜기발전소의 문을 여닫는 큰 열쇠.\n어찌된 영문인지\n갤럭시단이 지니고 있었다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une grande clé servant à ouvrir la porte de la\ncentrale Les Éoliennes du canyon.\nUn sbire de la Team Galaxie la détenait.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein großer Schlüssel, der zum Windkraftwerk\ngehört. Einer der Rüpel von Team Galaktik\nhatte ihn im Besitz.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Es necesario para participar en Concursos\nPokémon. Tiene una Cinta de ganador dibujada.",
