      "text": "A large key for operating the doors of the\nValley Windworks in the canyon. It was held by\na Team Galactic Grunt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "谷間の発電所の　扉を\nあけしめする　おおきな　カギ。\nなぜか　ギンガ団が　持っていた。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用来打开或关闭\n山谷发电厂大门的大钥匙。\n不知为何，它落入了银河队的手中。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Abre la puerta de la Central del Valle Eólico. La llevaba\nun Recluta del Equipo Galaxia.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    }
